[statement]
As `a-candidate-whose-dependency-cannot-be-met-is-passed-over-beside-one-depending-on-its-requirer`,
where the candidate passed over is the one depending on the package that
requires it: `a` 3 needs `missing` and `b`, and apk installs `a` 1.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:a
V:3
D:missing b

P:b
V:2
D:a

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install b 2
